          "snippet": "Although it is not part of the task battery itself, the different implementations of MATB offer the possibility of displaying a workload rating scale at any time. In general, a simplified version of the NASA-TLX (Hart &amp; Staveland, 1988) is implemented. Participants must use the mouse to evaluate each dimension of the scale.",
