          "snippet": "Moreover, MATB and MATB-II both included the NASA-TLX in order to assess the mental workload of the participants. However, automation researchers might be interested in presenting other rating scales during the performance of the task, such as those addressing the issue of trust and confidence in automation (Jian, Bisantz, &amp; Drury, 2000). However, such changes are currently not possible.",
